BT /F2 10 Tf 45 320.0 Td (1.1 The Educational Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 307.0 Td (Higher education institutions and online learning platforms record hundreds of hours of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 295.0 Td (classroom lectures every semester. While video capture has become standard, the **student) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 283.0 Td (learning experience with recorded lectures remains fundamentally broken**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 265.0 Td (- **Linear, Opaque Media**: Video recordings are opaque blobs of time. Finding where an) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 253.0 Td (instructor explained a specific formula, code snippet, or theoretical distinction requires) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 241.0 Td (manual, frustrating scrubbing through hours of video.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 229.0 Td (- **Code-Mixed & Bilingual Delivery**: In university environments globally \(and particularly in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 217.0 Td (India\), instructors naturally teach using bilingual code-mixed speech \(e.g., Hinglish -- mixing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 205.0 Td (English technical terminology with Hindi explanations\). Generic transcription tools fail) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 193.0 Td (drastically on this terminology.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 181.0 Td (- **Cognitive Overload**: Students reviewing a 60-to-90-minute lecture before exams struggle to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 169.0 Td (extract concise key takeaways or identify the logical topic boundaries within continuous) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 157.0 Td (speech.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 145.0 Td (- **Unverified AI Hallucinations**: Standard Generative AI chatbots \(like ChatGPT\) lack) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 133.0 Td (grounding in the specific course lectures. When students ask conceptual questions, generic LLMs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 121.0 Td (frequently hallucinate facts or contradict the instructor's specific curriculum notation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 109.0 Td (- **Lack of Targeted Remediation**: When students perform poorly on assessments, existing) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 97.0 Td (Learning Management Systems \(LMS\) provide raw numerical scores but fail to direct students to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 85.0 Td (the exact seconds in lecture recordings where the missing concept was taught.) Tj ET
