BT /F2 10 Tf 45 510.0 Td (12.1 Current System Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 497.0 Td (1. **CPU Speech Inference Latency**: Faster-Whisper running on CPU with `int8` quantization) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 485.0 Td (processes a 60-minute lecture in ~3 - 5 minutes. While acceptable for asynchronous background) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 473.0 Td (processing, it is not instantaneous.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 461.0 Td (2. **YouTube Audio Restriction**: YouTube's anti-bot protections block unauthenticated) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 449.0 Td (automated audio downloads via server IP addresses. As a result, YouTube lectures must have) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 437.0 Td (public captions enabled, or instructors must upload audio/video files directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 425.0 Td (3. **Local Filesystem Media Storage**: In development, media files are stored locally in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 413.0 Td (`data/uploads/`. Multi-instance horizontal scaling in production requires cloud object storage) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 401.0 Td (\(e.g., AWS S3 or Cloudflare R2\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 389.0 Td (4. **Extractive Rather than Abstractive Summaries**: The platform currently uses topic-centroid) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 377.0 Td (extractive ranking. While this eliminates hallucinations, it does not rephrase or synthesize) Tj ET
