BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 707.0 Td (#### Q8: Why is a Teacher Review Gate essential for Responsible AI in education?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 695.0 Td (**Answer**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 683.0 Td (Speech recognition can mishear domain terms \(e.g., transcribing *"SQL"* as *"sequel"* or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 671.0 Td (*"eigenvalues"* as *"I can values"*\), and automated question generation can occasionally) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 659.0 Td (generate flawed distractors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 647.0 Td (Releasing unmoderated AI outputs to students in higher education risks propagating) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 635.0 Td (misunderstandings. LectureLens enforces **Human-in-the-Loop AI**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 623.0 Td (- Newly ingested lectures require teacher review before publication \(`is_published = False`\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 611.0 Td (- Generated assessment questions default to `is_approved = False`. Students cannot see or take) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 599.0 Td (quizzes until the course instructor verifies them.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 587.0 Td (- All modifications are permanently recorded in MongoDB `audit_logs`.) Tj ET
0.8 w 0.8 0.8 0.8 RG 45 569.0 m 567 569.0 l S
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 553.0 Td (#### Q9: How does the Smart Revision algorithm diagnose weak topics?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 541.0 Td (**Answer**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 529.0 Td (Rather than relying on opaque deep-learning student modeling, LectureLens uses transparent,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 517.0 Td (rule-based reasoning:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 505.0 Td (1. It queries `quiz_attempts` for all tests taken by the student.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 493.0 Td (2. It aggregates correct and incorrect question responses grouped by `topic_id`.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 481.0 Td (3. If the error rate on any topic exceeds 33\\%, the topic is flagged as a weakness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 469.0 Td (4. The system presents the student with transparent feedback \(e.g., *"You missed 1 of 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 457.0 Td (question on Scaled Dot-Product Attention, 100% error rate"*\) and provides a one-click button) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 445.0 Td (deep-linking directly to that topic's video timestamp.) Tj ET
0.8 w 0.8 0.8 0.8 RG 45 427.0 m 567 427.0 l S
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 411.0 Td (#### Q10: How are user passwords and authorization tokens secured?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 399.0 Td (**Answer**:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 387.0 Td (1. **Passwords**: Salted and hashed using **Bcrypt** with a work factor of 12 rounds) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 375.0 Td (\(`bcrypt.hashpw\(password, bcrypt.gensalt\(12\)\)`\). Plain-text passwords are never stored in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 363.0 Td (database.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 351.0 Td (2. **Access Tokens**: Signed using **HMAC-SHA256 \(HS256\)** with a secret key. Tokens contain) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 339.0 Td (expiration timestamps \(`exp`\) and user role claims.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 327.0 Td (3. **Server-Side Authorization**: Every protected API route enforces role dependencies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 315.0 Td (\(`get_current_active_user`, `require_teacher`, `require_admin`\). Even if a client attempts to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.0 Tf 45 303.0 Td (bypass the UI, the FastAPI backend rejects unauthorized requests with HTTP 403 Forbidden.) Tj ET
0.8 w 0.8 0.8 0.8 RG 45 285.0 m 567 285.0 l S
